r interests. Some courses also allow you to select modules from our other programmes so you can broaden your experience and knowledge even further. ... Find out more about the courses on offer at Goldsmiths, University of London.\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"e0ada33fad56d2e0\">>>", "siteName": "www.ucas.com"}, {"title": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"39ee8242b87610a1\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nGoldsmiths, University of London Masters Degrees in Communication & Media Studies\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"39ee8242b87610a1\">>>", "url": "https://www.findamasters.com/masters-degrees/communication-and-media-studies/goldsmiths-university-of-london/", "description": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"c637c2f86e5359b8\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nThis Diploma is a Pre-Masters programme aimed at postgraduate students who are looking to develop or consolidate their language skills in academic… View course ... With an industry-informed curriculum, this future-focused MA combines computing and media and communications to reflect digital journalism at its most current. View course ... This course is split equally between teaching English and teaching Media Studies.\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"c637c2f86e5359b8\">>>", "siteName": "www.findamasters.com"}]}, "isError": false, "timestamp": 1776016870341}}
