{"type": "message", "id": "251d1320", "parentId": "58abcccf", "timestamp": "2026-04-12T18:02:09.514Z", "message": {"role": "toolResult", "toolCallId": "call_hd1rlu8vzrcehrqkm4k54g7q", "toolName": "web_search", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\n  \"query\": \"Goldsmiths MCCS full-time MA programmes 2025 list\",\n  \"provider\": \"brave\",\n  \"count\": 10,\n  \"tookMs\": 2114,\n  \"externalContent\": {\n    \"untrusted\": true,\n    \"source\": \"web_search\",\n    \"provider\": \"brave\",\n    \"wrapped\": true\n  },\n  \"results\": [\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"469e7ba6499e6f1a\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nCultural Studies | Goldsmiths, University of London\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"469e7ba6499e6f1a\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.postgrad.com/goldsmiths-university-of-london-media-communications-and-cultural-studies-cultural-studies/course/\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"00e6b25e7476e283\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nStudy Cultural Studies at Goldsmiths, University of London. Explore course details and what&#x27;s involved. From start dates, entry requirements and more.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"00e6b25e7476e283\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"www.postgrad.com\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"ed0fc3ce408b9133\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nGoldsmiths, University of London - Cultural Studies (Taught)\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"ed0fc3ce408b9133\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://digital.ucas.com/coursedisplay/courses/02d835a2-9868-bbf1-ac8a-c6cd170fe9fd\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"cf8000c2c2c856df\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nCompulsory modules Cultural Studies and Capitalism Doing Cultural Studies MA Cultural Studies Dissertation (Methodology and Research) Optional Modules You will take option modules to the value of 60 credits chosen from across Goldsmiths departments. There are several Media modules available to you on this programme.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"cf8000c2c2c856df\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"digital.ucas.com\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"89f9a6e5cc96c03e\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nCultural Studies at Goldsmiths, University of London\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"89f9a6e5cc96c03e\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://digital.ucas.com/coursedisplay/courses/02d835a2-9868-bbf1-ac8a-c6cd170fe9fd?SearchText=\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"ef3b1d7596627815\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nCompulsory modules Cultural Studies and Capitalism Doing Cultural Studies MA Cultural Studies Dissertation (Methodology and Research) Optional Modules You will take option modules to the value of 60 credits chosen from across Goldsmiths departments. There are several Media modules available to you on this programme.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"ef3b1d7596627815\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"digital.ucas.com\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"36831a20fe2bce25\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nMCCS Goldsmiths - YouTube\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"36831a20fe2bce25\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC9k9lXpgkG_fppiplcJMcoA\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"47471da6ddfac67f\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nThe School of Media, Communications and Cultural Studies is one of the world&#x27;s leading departments for media and communications teaching and research with internationally renowned researchers and practitioners. Housed in Goldsmiths&#x27; Professor Stuart Hall building with its purpose-built television/film, radio and photography studios, we offer a wide range of programmes at undergraduate, postgraduate and research degree level.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"47471da6ddfac67f\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"www.youtube.com\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"cc39dc1b23512298\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nMA Brands, Communication & Culture | Goldsmiths, University of London\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"cc39dc1b23512298\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.gold.ac.uk/pg/ma-brands-communication-culture/\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"57435f0c71918505\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nYou’ll benefit from being taught by experts in Media, Communications and Cultural Studies (MCCS) and Sociology. Our research interests are diverse, and you’ll be able to customise your degree by choosing from a range of optional modules to explore your own interests and broaden your perspectives. You&#x27;ll be part of a group of students who have a range of experiences and interests in communication, management, politics, design and the cultural and promotional industries. Media, Communications and Cultural Studies at Goldsmiths has been ranked second in the UK for &#x27;world-leading or internationally excellent&#x27; research (Research Excellence Framework, 2021) and 16th in the world (third in the UK) in the 2024 QS World Rankings for communication and media studies.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"57435f0c71918505\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"www.gold.ac.uk\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"696f3f3dcc04a2ce\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nGoldsmiths MCCS\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"696f3f3dcc04a2ce\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://vimeo.com/mediacomgold\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"2e84f00999b86574\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nDepartment of Media, Communications &amp; Cultural Studies Goldsmiths, University of London\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"2e84f00999b86574\\\">>>\",\n      \"published\": \"March 6, 2015\",\n      \"siteName\": \"vimeo.com\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"4f1bd42175f0db5a\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nSchool of Media, Communications and Cultural Studies | Goldsmiths, University of London\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"4f1bd42175f0db5a\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.gold.ac.uk/media-communications/\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"def089406d765e3b\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nAt the heart of the communications professions and media industries, we offer a range of degree programmes and study options.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"def089406d765e3b\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"www.gold.ac.uk\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"609718728c6ef320\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nGoldsmiths, University of London | Courses | UCAS\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"609718728c6ef320\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.ucas.com/explore/unis/a8aae742/goldsmiths-university-of-london/courses?studyYear=2025\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"62811897d132f296\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nGoldsmiths takes an innovative approach to teaching and learning, with an emphasis on exploring traditional subjects with new and challenging perspectives. In many courses, you’ll be able to pick from a wide range of optional modules, allowing you to tailor your learning to your particular interests. Some courses also allow you to select modules from our other programmes ...\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"62811897d132f296\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"www.ucas.com\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"b6a529a62ad35d3e\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nMA Promotional Media: PR, Advertising & Marketing | Goldsmiths, University of London\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"b6a529a62ad35d3e\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.gold.ac.uk/pg/ma-promotional-media/\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"cd72f51b48f70120\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nFor more information, please refer to our list of MCCS modules. Note about optional modules (if available): The above is indicative of the typical modules offered, but is not intended to be construed or relied on as a definitive list of what might be available in any given year. The module content and availability is subject to change. The Masters is built up of modules worth 180 credits. The programme comprises:\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"cd72f51b48f70120\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"www.gold.ac.uk\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"10a9baa3ed26e567\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nJournalism - Masters Degree at Goldsmiths 10713\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"10a9baa3ed26e567\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.postgraduatestudentships.co.uk/masters-course/journalism-5/10713\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"d3fca205be6a54e9\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nA melting-pot of ideas, one creative powerhouse One Goldsmiths At Goldsmiths, academic excellence and imaginative course content combine to make a pla... ... Masters programmes and scholarships in Human Rights, Social Work, Education, Art, Design and Media – apply now\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"d3fca205be6a54e9\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"www.postgraduatestudentships.co.uk\"\n    }\n  ]\n}"}], "details": {"query": "Goldsmiths MCCS full-time MA programmes 2025 list", "provider": "brave", "count": 10, "tookMs": 2114, "externalContent": {"untrusted": true, "source": "web_search", "provider": "brave", "wrapped": true}, "results": [{"title": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"469e7ba6499e6f1a\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nCul