e study of contemporary cultural processes</strong>. Each student will also complete a dissertation based on independent research, which is supported ...\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"fa1f6a94a6e5a86e\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"www.topuniversities.com\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"494205d34d48a817\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nSchool of Media, Communications and Cultural Studies | Goldsmiths, University of London\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"494205d34d48a817\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.gold.ac.uk/media-communications/\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"ea22552563b85973\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nUndergraduate, Postgraduate and Research degrees in the School of Media, Communications and Cultural Studies. Get in touch about studying with us. Life as a Goldsmiths student, how to apply and more.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"ea22552563b85973\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"www.gold.ac.uk\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"618c37a27ebcdbef\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nMedia, Communications and Cultural Studies | Goldsmiths, Un…\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"618c37a27ebcdbef\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.postgrad.com/goldsmiths-university-of-london-media-communications-and-cultural-studies-media-communications-and-cultural-studies/course/\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"9927f388a6585aa4\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nThe Department of Media, Communications and Cultural Studies has been ranked second in the UK for &#x27;world-leading or internationally excellent&#x27; research (Research Excellence Framework, 2021) and 16th in the world (third in the UK) in the 2024 QS World Rankings for communication and media studies. Areas of research We give priority to those with proposals for research within the areas of